    "created_at": "2023-05-26T16:50:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-05-26T16:50:55Z",
    "body": "Use any element, but link it to figure with aria-labelledby.\r\n\r\nYour argument about heading levels was never valid because there were no real world implementations of it. See #7829 for more.",
